# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECRETS
# Left blank here; real values live only in .env.local (gitignored) or the
# Worker's own secret store. This is a plain Worker, not SvelteKit, so
# nothing here is baked into the bundle -- `wrangler dev` reads .env and
# .env.local locally, and production needs `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Shared with ontology, which checks it on /scheduled/sync -- any long random string (e.g.
# `openssl rand -hex 32`); see apps/scheduler/README.md for setting it on both Workers
SCHEDULER_TOKEN=
